  "sourceVitestConfigDifferencesFromCapsule": [
    "Original installed Vitest4.1.11 and Node24.19.0. Minimal node config omits aliases, DOM/canvas/host-port setup, feature-wall define, GC/WebStorage flags and extended timeouts. This whole suite explicitly binds ephemeral loopback ports, uses no GC/DOM hooks and restores mocks; it does not require that setup for these two assertions.",
    "Transport package trees are pinned. Optional ws native peers are disabled per child via WS_NO_BUFFER_UTIL=1 and WS_NO_UTF_8_VALIDATE=1; real ws/tweetnacl/zod implementations remain. Native-addon/performance, full config and real SSH equivalence are not established."
