  "isolationRationale": "Root read whole two-case original suite and all33 source files in its runtime import closure. Source module initialization creates constants/schemas/an in-memory admission set; no profiles, filesystem writes, subprocesses or external service connection. Test creates ephemeral WebSocketServer on127.0.0.1, random throwaway NaCl keys and literal fixture tokens; sends only status/terminal fixture requests or test.hang to that server. Original afterEach closes all owned server clients and servers; connection.close clears its state/timers. Arbitrary callbacks and other exported subscription/request functions remain staged but are not invoked by these tests.",
  "testEvidenceBoundary": "One encrypted socket reused for two requests with capability payload and response checks; one request aborted while same connection remains usable. This does not prove remote work cancellation, general reconnect, SSH/Tailscale, native Electron, real runtime dispatch, independent cryptographic security, migrated behavior or product parity.",
